Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Jarvis voxray: Vobiz-compatible voice AI

---
 Dockerfile.jarvis                   |  32 ++++++
 pkg/frames/serialize/vobiz/vobiz.go | 160 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/runner/telephony.go             |  16 +++
 pkg/server/server.go                |  29 ++++-
 4 files changed, 233 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Dockerfile.jarvis
